 you more ways than ever before to immerse yourself in all aspects of tabletop gaming!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/aa65188199ec0223935bd6efdffb3740.poster.avif?t=1626460631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/aa65188199ec0223935bd6efdffb3740.webm?t=1626460631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/aa65188199ec0223935bd6efdffb3740.mp4?t=1626460631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/f0dbca799765a4477feecbda71c54ea5.avif?t=1626460631\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/265c1b82b59ec360935ae4bad981d7ae.avif?t=1626460631\" /></div><br><br>Build truly unique maps and scenes for each encounter your adventure hurls at you, with animated spells and line of sight indicators you can map out the battlefield to make the most of your chance to get that sneak attack<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/f1d79882ac0c6a3bfc0cc4f6f8604d66.poster.avif?t=1626460631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/f1d79882ac0c6a3bfc0cc4f6f8604d66.webm?t=1626460631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427700/extras/f1d79882ac0c6a3bfc0cc4f6f8604d66.mp4?t=1626460631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\"